        },
        {
          "rank": 3,
          "video_id": "LHpplKlnXes",
          "seq": 15,
          "t": 467,
          "t_end": 474,
          "score": 0.531111,
          "hl": "And building these loops is what's really important because one who can do this reliably and at scale, well, that's a good AI engineer.",
